    <guid isPermaLink="false">6603c6001519139e4fe2a565</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Mar 2024 07:08:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小七@小七wayne</span></p><span></span><p><span>囧@囧大耳朵（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span>付二@付二脱口秀（小红书）</span></p><span></span><p><span>@付二：</span></p><span></span><p><span>我从一个设计师，变成销售，后面创业，体验过10来种工作生活，北上广深杭都呆过，只想告诉你一件事：</span></p><span></span><p><span>树挪死，人挪活。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一代人有一代人的辫子</span></p><span></span><p><span>别怕，别焦虑，勇敢去选择。</span></p><span></span><p><span>走一步算一步，实在不行死半路。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【show note】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a>-付二专场的大致内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="147">02:27</a>-付二成长经历中的趣事、冲突与适应</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a>-大学生活与大学生设计工作室</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a>-兴趣驱使下的脱口秀入行经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a>-民宿青旅开店经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2747">45:47</a>-剧本杀dm</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>-萌宠体验馆的经营与倒闭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3723">62:03</a>-脱口秀经历：人与地域</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4194">69:54</a>-中年焦虑与自由意志</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4981">83:01</a>-付二专场中的一段话收尾</span></p><span></span><p><span>付二专场【逃离一会】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Foatje9xtNtLZ3OGCNxJKtdxKUn8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>🕰3月29日 <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a></span></p><span></span><p><span>📍杭州湖滨银泰in77E区二楼</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Burning Friday Night (激情周五之夜) - Lucky Kilimanjaro</span></p><span></span><p><span>Magic Hour - Special Favorite Music (スペシャル・フェイバリット・ミュージック)</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作：安徒</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：安徒</span></p>]]></description>
